3. If all is well, call discordant_pairs next.
4. Then soft_clipped_reads and split_reads if needed.
5. Finally, use read_depth_profile to assess the depth profile around the candidate breakpoint.
6. Call breakpoint_evidence_summary with applicable_layers obtained from step 1.

